        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Seems related to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41664 .  With follow-mode enabled, it seems intuitive if `]C` `[C` leaves a cursor behind. Maybe the leave-a-cursor behavior should happen when follow-mode is on, otherwise not.",
